        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved on the latest `main`.\n\nAfter talking on the Matrix with Neovim core, it seems that a safe range for `priority` is (at least) from 1 to 65535 (`2^16 - 1`). So let's try using 4097 and 4098 as `priority` that has the intention of \"always be on top\".\n\nThanks again for noticing and reporting this!",
